firmware/bam_native.c is a fixed-point C re-implementation of the trajectory
definitions in bam/trajectory.py at commit
b9e11118e17fe8ec803d430202f6fcf31d57901e. It has been modified from the
original (rewritten in C11, Q16 fixed point, table-based sine).

research/calibration/* and tests/stock_calibration.c, which read the servo's
factory calibration table and settings journal, were written independently from
observed behaviour and data layout, not copied from ROBOTIS code.

